  "ruleText": "Rev 3103.01 Form DP-300, Gambling Winnings Tax Return. Form DP-300, Revised 2/2010, “Gambling Winnings Tax Return”, shall be completed and filed with the department by taxpayers who received gambling winnings in the preceding calendar year.\n\nSource. #9689-A, eff 4-2-10",
